  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220oC/200oC fan-forced.\n• Cut cauliflower into small florets. Cut carrot and zucchini into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with All-American spice blend and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender and browned around the edges, 20-25 minutes. Set aside to cool slightly. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62158a1740eebf452833f26b/step-45412aa0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While veggies are roasting, cut or tear ciabatta into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place on a second lined oven tray, then drizzle with olive oil and sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning. Toss to coat.\n• Sprinkle with the grated Parmesan cheese.\n• Bake until golden, 5-8 minutes. TIP: Adding enough olive oil ensures the croutons get crunchy and golden!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62158a1740eebf452833f26b/step-0b317d30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To slightly cooled roast veggie tray, add mixed leaves, caramelised onion chutney and a drizzle of white wine vinegar.\n• Toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62158a1740eebf452833f26b/step-ef7be3b4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide spiced cauliflower toss between plates.\n• Top with cheesy croutons and a drizzle of dill & parsley mayonnaise.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62158a1740eebf452833f26b/step-e2b55504.jpg"
    }
  ]
